    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i'm not one of those people? like what if i'm just the person that the pattern stops at? it feels like everything i do just makes things worse for the people around me. if i could just cut the cord and make sure this doesn't pass on to anyone else, wouldnt that be better? just ending the cycle right here so no one else has to deal with it.",
