      "content": "i hear you, but it feels so selfish to keep going when i know i'm just like them. i'm just a vessel for the same mess. honestly, if i wasn't around, there'd be no more chance for the cycle to continue through me. it feels like the only way to actually be \"good\" is to ensure i'm not a part of it anymore. like, if the chain breaks because i'm gone, isnt that a cleaner way to handle it?",
